  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Trust Funds Specific Projects</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A total of seven payments are made under this budget line to UN Trust Funds and Projects, reflecting the priorities of Ireland&apos;s international development policy, A Better World. These include UN Women-managed trust funds to support progress on gender equality and women&apos;s empowerment is in line with Goal 5 of the SDGs. For the first time in 2023, this budget line is being used to provide funding to the UNFPA&apos;s Suppliers&apos; Trust Fund. A contribution is also made to the Office of the President of the UN General Assembly to support the day-to-day operations of the Office. Grants are also made to other UN projects such as the Joint SDG Fund and the Women&apos;s Peace and Humanitarian Fund, as well as a UNDP evaluative study on the SDGs.</narrative>
  </description>
